OL,3,GNEWSAGold medallist's plan to open
OL,4,Afirst sumo club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gold medal-winning wrestler has said
OL,7,Fhe hopes to open what is believed to be
OL,8,Fthe first sumo wrestling club in West
OL,9,FYorkshire.
OL,11,FPlans have been submitted to Bradford
OL,12,FCouncil to transform a former coach
OL,13,Fdepot in Bingley into a martial arts
OL,14,Fstudio.
OL,16,FThe project is being led by Alex Gent,
OL,17,Fwho won gold in the men's lightweight
OL,18,Fcategory of the British Sumo Federation
OL,19,FChampionships in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
