OL,3,GNEWSAGold medallist's plan to open
OL,4,Afirst sumo club
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning documents state that Gent's
OL,7,Fcompany, Axivium, formerly known as
OL,8,FMartial Weapons Academy, wants to
OL,9,Frefurbish the dilapidated depot on Ash
OL,10,FTerrace into a studio for 10 students
OL,11,Fat a time.
